 "intro_zh": "龙川是坑口村的古称，该村地势独特，风景优美，是胡姓聚族而居的古村落。龙川旅游风景区人文景观与自然景观珠联璧合，浑然天成。龙川胡氏宗祠，1988年被评为全国重点文物保护单位。",
 "intro_en": "Longchuan is the ancient name of Hangkou Village. The village has unique terrain and beautiful scenery. It is an ancient village where the Hu family lives together. The cultural landscape and natural landscape of Longchuan Tourist Scenic Area are a perfect combination and a perfect match. Longchuan Hu Ancestral Hall was rated as a national key cultural relic protection unit in 1988.",
